* Magnetiser SPICE models (ngspice). Behavioural, fitted to datasheet numbers.
* Units: SI. All models valid for 25 degC unless noted.

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* IXYS/Littelfuse CLA100E1200HB thyristor (TO-247: 1=K 2=A 3=G)
* On-state: VT = 1.37 V @ 100 A (25 degC) with rT = 5 mOhm slope resistance
*   (datasheet rT = 5.2 mOhm). At 2 kA this gives ~11 V per SCR.
* Gate: VGT ~1.1 V @ 40 mA (2 ohm spreading R); latches when IG > IGT = 40 mA.
* Regenerative: once conducting with anode current > IH = 100 mA it latches and
*   holds without gate drive; blocks again below IH (natural commutation).
* Smooth (tanh) logic and a conductance-controlled switch keep ngspice converging.
* Turn-on delay ~1 us (tgd = 2 us max). No dv/dt or tq modelling.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt CLA100E1200HB A G K
Vsa A a1 0
Bsw a1 a2 I = V(a1,a2) * (1e3 * V(lat) + 1e-8)
D1 a2 K DSCR
Dg G g1 DGATE
Vsg g1 K 0
Blat x 0 V = max(0.5*(1+tanh((I(Vsg)-40m)/5m)),
+ 0.5*(1+tanh((V(lat)-0.1)/0.02)) * 0.5*(1+tanh((I(Vsa)-100m)/20m)))
Rlat x lat 1k
Clat lat 0 1n
.model DSCR D(IS=1.8e-8 N=1.5 RS=5m BV=1300)
.model DGATE D(IS=1.6e-10 N=2 RS=2 CJO=1n)
.ends

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Vishay VO4258H phototriac (DIP-6: 1=A 2=C 4=MT1 6=MT2)
* LED Vf ~1.2 V @ 10 mA. Output on while IF > IFT; IFT(H bin) = 2 mA max,
*   modelled at 1.5 mA. VTM = 3 V max @ 300 mA, modelled as 8 ohm.
* No latching of the triac itself (LED pulse is held longer than SCR latch).
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt VO4258H A C MT1 MT2
Dled A l1 DLED
Vsl l1 C 0
Bon x 0 V = 0.5*(1+tanh((I(Vsl)-1.5m)/0.2m))
Ron x on 1k
Con on 0 1n
Bsw MT2 MT1 I = V(MT2,MT1) * (V(on) / 8 + 1.25e-10)
.model DLED D(IS=2.5e-13 N=1.9)
.ends

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Anti-parallel / freewheel diode: Vishay VS-60EPS12-M3 (1200 V, 60 A, IFSM 1000 A).
*   Fitted to VF = 1.09 V @ 60 A; RS extrapolates to ~2.3 V @ 500 A.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.model DCROWBAR D(IS=1.7e-8 N=1.6 RS=3m BV=1200 TT=1u CJO=200p)

